      "agent_input": "Approved\u2014please continue with the conversion process.",
      "agent_response": {
        "response": "[Awaiting tool approval]\n\n**Policy:** Shell command approval (skills demo)\nAbout to run a shell command in the agent workspace. Approve to continue?\n**Required Tools:** run_command\n```python\nprobe = await run_command(\"which pandoc 2>/dev/null || echo 'no pandoc'; which wkhtmltopdf 2>/dev/null || echo 'no wkhtmltopdf'; python -c 'from docx import Document; print(\\\"python-docx OK\\\")' 2>&1; python -c 'import fpdf; print(\\\"fpdf OK\\\")' 2>&1; python -c 'import reportlab; print(\\\"reportlab OK\\\")' 2>&1; python -c 'import weasyprint; print(\\\"weasyprint OK\\\")' 2>&1\")\nprint(probe)\n\nimport asyncio\n\ninstall = await run_command(\"uv pip install python-docx fpdf2 2>&1\")\nprint(install)\nawait asyncio.sleep(5)\n\nverify = await run_command(\"python -c \\\"from docx import Document; from fpdf import FPDF; print('both OK')\\\"\")\nprint(verify)\n\nscript = r'''\nimport sys\nfrom docx import Document\nfrom fpdf import FPDF\nimport email\nfrom email.mime.multipart import MIMEMultipart\nfrom email.mime.text import MIMEText\nfrom email.mime.base import MIMEBase\nfrom email import encoders\nimport base64\n\n# --- Step 1: Read DOCX ---\ndoc = Document(\"testbed/docs/customer_report.docx\")\n\n# --- Step 2: Convert to PDF ---\npdf = FPDF()\npdf.set_auto_page_break(auto=True, margin=15)\npdf.add_page()\n\nfor para in doc.paragraphs:\n    text = para.text.strip()\n    if not text:\n        pdf.ln(4)\n        continue\n\n    style_name = para.style.name if para.style else \"\"\n\n    if style_name.startswith(\"Heading 1\") or (para.runs and para.runs[0].bold and len(text) > 20):\n        pdf.set_font(\"Helvetica\", \"B\", 16)\n        pdf.multi_cell(0, 8, text.encode('latin-1', 'replace').decode('latin-1'))\n        pdf.ln(3)\n    elif style_name.startswith(\"Heading 2\"):\n        pdf.set_font(\"Helvetica\", \"B\", 13)\n        pdf.multi_cell(0, 7, text.encode('latin-1', 'replace').decode('latin-1'))\n        pdf.ln(2)\n    elif style_name.startswith(\"Heading\"):\n        pdf.set_font(\"Helvetica\", \"B\", 11)\n        pdf.multi_cell(0, 6, text.encode('latin-1', 'replace').decode('latin-1'))\n        pdf.ln(2)\n    else:\n        # Check if paragraph has bold runs\n        if para.runs and all(r.bold for r in para.runs if r.text.strip()):\n            pdf.set_font(\"Helvetica\", \"B\", 10)\n        else:\n            pdf.set_font(\"Helvetica\", \"\", 10)\n        pdf.multi_cell(0, 5, text.encode('latin-1', 'replace').decode('latin-1'))\n        pdf.ln(1)\n\npdf_path = \"testbed/docs/customer_report.pdf\"\npdf.output(pdf_path)\nprint(f\"PDF created: {pdf_path}\")\n\n# --- Step 3: Build .eml with PDF attachment ---\nmsg = MIMEMultipart()\nmsg[\"From\"] = \"assistant@example.com\"\nmsg[\"To\"] = \"bob@example.com\"\nmsg[\"Subject\"] = \"Customer Report (PDF)\"\nmsg[\"MIME-Version\"] = \"1.0\"\n\nbody = MIMEText(\n    \"Hi Bob,\\n\\nPlease find the customer report attached as a PDF.\\n\\nBest regards\",\n    \"plain\",\n    \"utf-8\"\n)\nmsg.attach(body)\n\nwith open(pdf_path, \"rb\") as f:\n    pdf_data = f.read()\n\nattachment = MIMEBase(\"application\", \"pdf\")\nattachment.set_payload(pdf_data)\nencoders.encode_base64(attachment)\nattachment.add_header(\"Content-Disposition\", \"attachment\", filename=\"customer_report.pdf\")\nmsg.attach(attachment)\n\neml_path = \"testbed/emails/bob/Customer Report.eml\"\nwith open(eml_path, \"w\") as f:\n    f.write(msg.as_string())\n\nprint(f\"Email saved: {eml_path}\")\nprint(\"Done!\")\n'''\nawait write_file(\"./convert_and_email.py\", script)\nprint(\"Script written\")\n\nresult = await run_command(\"python ./convert_and_email.py\")\nprint(result)\n\npdf_info = await get_file_info(\"testbed/docs/customer_report.pdf\")\nprint(\"PDF:\", pdf_info)\n\neml_info = await get_file_info(\"testbed/emails/bob/Customer Report.eml\")\nprint(\"EML:\", eml_info)\n```",
        "status_code": null
      },
